name: Glow Up — editions very common
author: corpus
description: >-
  Glow Up makes Foil, Holographic, and Polychrome editions appear 4x more often. Tier-2
  voucher: requires Hone bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2.
  RAG aliases: edition flood, shiny jokers, polychrome hunt, negative hunt.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: GlowUp
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - tarotCard: TheWheelOfFortune
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: JokerStencil
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
